# Maya Collection server configuration
# Configure ADMIN_PANEL_PASSWORD and SESSION_SECRET in Netlify environment
# settings with Functions scope for the deployment context being used.
# Never prefix server secrets with VITE_ or commit their values.
# Netlify automatically supplies the managed database and Blobs configuration.
# Supabase environment variables are no longer used by the application.
# Optional existing AI tools require their server-side provider configuration.
